<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia British Assurance year net up.</title>
<headline>Malaysia British Assurance year net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   13.50	  vs	 11.41</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  34.0	   vs	 29.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    269.20	  vs	240.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     29.95	  vs	 26.25</p>
<p>    Minorities	loss	0.39	  vs  loss  0.37</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries gain	9.50	  vs  loss  0.28</p>
<p>Note - Malaysia British Assurance Bhd is an insurance company.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
